 - `Calendar.cancel(appointment_id, at)` cancels a booked appointment and records `cancelled_at`.
 - `Calendar.move(appointment_id, new_start)` reschedules a booked appointment. Cancelled and other non-booked appointments cannot be moved.
 - `make_invoice(appointment, patient, number, amount_cents)` builds an `Invoice` dated the appointment's local date. The patient name is left out, as the privacy rules require for files that leave the system.
+- `slots.free_slots(calendar, therapist, day, kind)` gives the local start times (sorted `datetime.time` values, on quarter hours) where a new appointment of `kind` fits on a local date. A slot is free if it and its note gap (15 minutes after an assessment) do not overlap any non-cancelled appointment of the therapist. It returns nothing once the therapist has 8 non-cancelled patient appointments that day. Clinic opening hours are not defined yet, so every quarter hour of the day is considered.
 
